meta {
  name: Stream Stats (Unified)
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/sse/stats
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{jwt_token}}
}

docs {
  Single SSE stream carrying every collected stats event (CPU, memory, disk,
  network) tagged by variant. Prefer this over the per-resource streams when
  the client wants everything: one connection, one auth check, one keepalive.

  Event payload (JSON in `data:`):
    StatsEvent::Cpu(...) | StatsEvent::Memory(...) | StatsEvent::Disk(...)
    | StatsEvent::Network(...)
  See `src/models/stats.rs` for the exact shape.

  Note: Bruno's SSE rendering is limited; for sustained streaming use curl:
    curl -N -H "Authorization: Bearer $JWT" http://localhost:8080/sse/stats
}
